    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1256">

                <pb facs="1004" n="888" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg888"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.6363/178a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Vice Consul Bevan</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-03-30">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 30, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>If an engagement is threatened near Tampico, you will please confer immediately
                    with the respective leaders and caution them against the destruction of the oil
                    properties, pointing out the danger of conflagration and the possibility of
                    great damage being done to both life and property.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
